{:edb/db-before-t 1246 :edb/db-after-t 1247 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534559 50 #inst "2026-10-08T00:54:54.313Z" 13194139534559 true] [17592186184294 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295343 13194139534559 true] [17592186184294 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295353 13194139534559 true] [17592186184295 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295336 13194139534559 true] [17592186184296 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295350 13194139534559 true] [17592186184414 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534559 true] [17592186184414 1100 "Evaluate the integral $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln 3}}5xe^{x^{2}}dx$." 13194139534559 false] [17592186184414 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}5x{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534559 true] [17592186184414 1145 "Let's introduce the new variable $u={x}^{2}.$ Differentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNext, we determine the new limits of integration:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\operatorname{ln}⁡3$ |\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}5x{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}5{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}5{e}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{u}\\,{|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}(3-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}(2) \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295336 1017 #edb/ref 17592186295337 13194139534559 true] [17592186295336 1089 "q-113873" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295336 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534559 true] [17592186295336 1100 "Calculate the integral$\\int \\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}-2x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295336 1113 #uuid "5f23ffa8-d0a8-52a4-a9f1-7e4b93545877" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295336 1145 "Notice that the numerator is proportional to the derivative of the denominator. So, we introduce the new variable $u={e}^{2x}-2x.$ Differentiating gives \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2{e}^{2x}-2=2({e}^{2x}-1)\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=({e}^{2x}-1)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}-2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{e}^{2x}-2x}\\cdot ({e}^{2x}-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295338 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295339 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295340 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295341 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295342 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1041 "selection" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1104 #edb/ref 17592186295338 13194139534559 true] [17592186295337 1110 #uuid "d04580a8-0497-5115-8eff-e675387c84f9" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295338 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{2}+C" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295338 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534559 true] [17592186295338 1111 #uuid "53bd91de-4eca-5a38-a382-b6ff340ad68c" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295339 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{{e}^{2x}}+C" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295339 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534559 true] [17592186295339 1111 #uuid "69c97d5b-039a-5b14-b7fc-546d1a6b37c4" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295340 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{2{e}^{2x}}+C" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295340 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534559 true] [17592186295340 1111 #uuid "0badacbd-52bd-