ts of integration:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\operatorname{ln}⁡2$ | $4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2$ |\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}}x{e}^{3{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{e}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}{e}^{u}\\,{|}_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}({e}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(16-2) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295351 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295352 13194139534559 true] [17592186295351 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534559 true] [17592186295351 1041 "field-1" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295351 1104 #edb/ref 17592186295352 13194139534559 true] [17592186295351 1110 #uuid "387d027e-846e-512e-86a1-d903d71d9c4c" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295352 1034 "\\frac{7}{3}" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295352 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534559 true] [17592186295352 1111 #uuid "4650bfd0-5fae-5a0a-aa31-d40db246d261" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295353 1017 #edb/ref 17592186295354 13194139534559 true] [17592186295353 1089 "q-73802" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295353 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534559 true] [17592186295353 1100 "Calculate the integral $\\int x{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295353 1113 #uuid "9f4889fd-f600-5c4d-a014-13ded0431d92" 13194139534559 true] [17592186295353 1145 "Let's introduce the new variable $u={x}^{2}-7.$ Differentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {7}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {7}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\